OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after man killed and bus
OL,4,Adriver badly hurt
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men, aged 25 and 26, were arrested
OL,7,Fat the scene on suspicion of causing
OL,8,Fdeath by dangerous driving. A
OL,9,F51-year-old man was later arrested for
OL,10,Fthe same offence. They all remain in
OL,11,Fcustody.
OL,13,FActing Det Insp Fiaz Janjua said the
OL,14,FMet was working to "build a full
OL,15,Fpicture of this incident".
